⭐ Interview Tip

The optimal solution reduces the 2D matrix problem to multiple instances of LeetCode 84 (Largest Rectangle in Histogram). Build a histogram for each row by counting consecutive 1s vertically, then use a monotonic increasing stack to find the largest rectangle in O(n) for that row. Overall complexity becomes O(m × n), which is the expected optimal solution.
